    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA McGee are delighted to present No. 15 Dakota Court, a stunning ground-floor apartment overlooking the Grand Canal.\r\n\r\nThis superb property comprises an inviting entrance hallway with a convenient storage closet, a generously sized family bathroom, and a spacious double bedroom. The apartment also features a well-appointed kitchen and a bright, light-filled living and dining area, which opens onto a private balcony with beautiful views of the Grand Canal. This property also benefits from a secure underground designated car parking space.\r\n\r\nDakota Court is a highly sought-after and private development, ideally located just a short stroll from the city centre, the National Botanic Gardens, and the many amenities of Phibsborough Village. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, including the Luas offering excellent connectivity throughout Dublin."
      },
